00:00:00.003 --> 00:00:06.160
Speaker 1: OK, one other quick story here. We&nbsp;
now have an actual poll. What did people think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.800
of Joe Biden's first official State of the Union&nbsp;
address on Tuesday? Remember, I gave it a b,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.800
and I thought there were some good parts and some&nbsp;
not so good parts. Almost 80 percent of those who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:23.840
watched it believe that Joe Biden was on point and&nbsp;
approve of his remarks. This is surprising even to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:30.560
me, quite frankly. Nearly eight in 10 of State of&nbsp;
the Union watchers approve of Joe Biden's remarks.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:39.200
78 percent in a new CBS YouGov poll said that they&nbsp;
approve of Biden's remarks. Twenty two percent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.480
disapproved. Those surveys surveyed were also&nbsp;
asked to check all of the feelings that applied to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:49.840
them. And many said they came away with positive&nbsp;
feelings. 67 percent said they were optimistic.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.160
Fifty percent said they felt proud. Only&nbsp;
20 percent said they were pessimistic and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.160 --> 00:01:02.880
13 percent angry. Now you have to consider that&nbsp;
it is. This is of people who watched and quite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:08.400
certainly because it's a Democratic president.&nbsp;
More of those who watched may indeed be Democrats.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:14.960
But there's also a CNN poll conducted by SARS,&nbsp;
which said 71 percent had a positive reaction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:20.720
although again, friendlier audiences.&nbsp;
More Democrats than Republicans tend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:25.520
to be attracted to these speeches. A couple of&nbsp;
different notes here number one. Some of these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.800
Insta polls online, yeah, there's a&nbsp;
lot of right wingers will say, Whoa,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:37.120
look at this 40. Only 48 percent liked the speech.&nbsp;
Understand that those Insta polls are worth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:44.000
the gum on the pre chewed gum on the bottom of&nbsp;
your shoe. The really worth nothing. Anybody,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.000
whether you saw the speech or not, can weigh&nbsp;
in. And even people who might have thought the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.400
