notoriously not accurate. We really should be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:59.120
looking at actual polling. A couple different&nbsp;
thoughts. One. There may be a little bit of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:05.600
rally around the flag going on the Ukrainian flag,&nbsp;
and we know in general approval for presidents and&nbsp;&nbsp;

